            <div xml:id="d67-a28">

                <pb facs="0483" n="471" sameAs="frus:frus1946v04/pg471"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 28]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the Yugoslav Delegation on Article
                        34</hi></head>
                <p>The Yugoslav delegation has already pointed out that this Conference is not
                    competent to decide anything in connection with the regime of the Danube. Seeing
                    that our sovereign rights are guaranteed by the Charter of the United Nations,
                    we consider that no decision of this Conference or of this Commission can be
                    binding on Yugoslavia.</p>
                <p>I would request you, Mr. Chairman, to have this statement inserted in the Record
                    of Decisions.</p>
            </div>
